.SH "نام (NAME)"
gnome-photos \- Access, organize and share your photos on GNOME
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBgnome\-photos\fR\ 'u
\fBgnome\-photos\fR [\fIOPTION\fR...]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBgnome\-photos\fR
is an application to access, organize and share your photos on GNOME\&. A simple and elegant replacement for using a file manager to deal with photos\&. Enhance, crop and edit in a snap\&. Seamless cloud integration is offered through GNOME Online Accounts\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB\-\-help, \-h\fR
.RS 4
Show a brief overview of all the options\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-help\-all\fR
.RS 4
Show all the options in detail\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-help\-gapplication\fR
.RS 4
Show all the GApplication options\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-help\-gtk\fR
.RS 4
Show all the GTK options\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-empty\-results\fR
.RS 4
Show the empty state\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-version\fR
.RS 4
Show the application\*(Aqs version\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-gapplication\-service\fR
.RS 4
Enter GApplication service mode\&. To be used from D\-Bus service files\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-class=CLASS\fR
.RS 4
Program class as used by the window manager\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-display=DISPLAY\fR
.RS 4
X display to use\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-g\-fatal\-warnings\fR
.RS 4
Make all warnings fatal\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-gdk\-debug=FLAGS\fR
.RS 4
GDK debugging flags to set\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-gdk\-no\-debug=FLAGS\fR
.RS 4
GDK debugging flags to unset\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-gtk\-debug=FLAGS\fR
.RS 4
GTK debugging flags to set\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-gtk\-no\-debug=FLAGS\fR
.RS 4
GTK debugging flags to unset\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-gtk\-module=MODULES\fR
.RS 4
Load additional GTK modules\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-name=NAME\fR
.RS 4
Program name as used by the window manager\&.
.RE
.SH "اشکالات (BUGS)"
.PP
Please send bug reports to either the distribution bug tracker or the upstream bug tracker at
\m[blue]\fB\%https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-photos/issues\fR\m[]\&. There are some debugging tips at
\m[blue]\fB\%https://wiki.gnome.org/Apps/Photos/Debugging\fR\m[]
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
For further information, visit the website
\m[blue]\fB\%https://wiki.gnome.org/Apps/Photos\fR\m[]\&.
